    <description>Creates the brand's configured tasks (Opportunity_Task_Template__mdt) on an Opportunity. A template fires on create (Trigger Event = On Create) or when the stage changes to the stage named in Trigger Event. Rows with a blank Brand are used when the brand has no rows of its own. Assign To: Opportunity Owner, Owner's Manager, Brand Leader (Brand_Configuration Brand_Leader_Alias__c) or Specific User (alias). Missing manager, leader or user falls back to the owner. Due date = creation date plus Days Until Due. Bypassed by SPX_Bypass_Automation.</description>
    <formulas>
        <name>fTrigger</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(ISNEW(), "On Create", TEXT({!$Record.StageName}))</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fDue</name>
        <dataType>Date</dataType>
        <expression>TODAY() + {!Loop_Templates.Days_Until_Due__c}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>SPX Opportunity Tasks {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>SPX Opportunity Tasks</label>
